* Methods

** (BR) Modify the bitrate, using:
@code bash
ffmpeg -i $infile -b $bitrate $newoutfile
@end

** (CR) Vary the Constant Rate Factor, using:
@code bash
ffmpeg -i $infile -vcodec libx264 -crf 23 $outfile
@end

CRF has no fixed quality or original-file-size percentage. For the same video and settings, each increase of 6 CRF roughly halves the video size. Using CRF 23 as 100%:

| CRF | estimated video size |
|-----|----------------------|
| 17  | 200%                 |
| 18  | 178%                 |
| 20  | 141%                 |
| 21  | 126%                 |
| 22  | 112%                 |
| 23  | 100%                 |
| 24  | 89%                  |
| 25  | 79%                  |
| 26  | 71%                  |
| 27  | 63%                  |
| 28  | 56%                  |
| 29  | 50%                  |

These are estimates relative to CRF 23, not percentages of the input file. Audio is unaffected. For a maximum size, try the estimated CRF and measure the result.

** (SZ) Change the video screen-size (for example to half its pixel size), using:
@code bash
ffmpeg -i $infile -vf "scale=iw/2:ih/2" $outfile
@end

** (BL) Change the H.264 profile to "baseline", using:
@code bash
ffmpeg -i $infile -profile:v baseline $outfile
@end

** (DF) Use the default ffmpeg processing, using:
@code bash
ffmpeg -i $infile $outfile
@end

* Examples

- "size"       - percent pixel size of the converted video in relation to the original.
- "bitrate"    - bitrates of original and converted videos.
- "definition" - pixel size of videos.
- "convert"    - time to convert the video in seconds.

             | original  | BR        | CR        | SZ      |   BL        |  DF       |
|------------|-----------|-----------|-----------|---------|-------------|-----------|
|size        | 64152 kb  | 214%      | 76%       | 40%     |   83%       |  76%      |
|bitrate     | 411 kb/s  | 883       | 313       | 165     |   342       |  313      |
|definition  | 1920x1080 | 1920x1080 | 1920x1080 | 960x540 |   1920x1080 |  1920x1080|
|convert     | --        | 648       | 509       | 225     |   427       |  510      |

=========================================================================================

             | original  | BR        | CR        | SZ        |   BL        |  DF       |
|------------|-----------|-----------|-----------|-----------|-------------|-----------|
|size        |410301 kb  |33%        | 109%      | 28%       | 143%        | 109%      |
|bitrate     |2687 kb/s  |880        | 2920      | 764       | 3843        | 2920      |
|definition  |3840x2160  |3840x2160  | 3840x2160 | 1920x1080 | 3840x2160   | 3840x2160 |
